sequenceDiagram
    participant Orchestrator as Platform Orchestrator
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Operator as workbenches-operator<br/>controller-manager
    participant FS as /opt/manifests<br/>(Filesystem)
    participant HWWebhook as Hardware Profile<br/>Webhook :9443/TCP
    participant ConnWebhook as Connection Notebook<br/>Webhook :9443/TCP
    participant HWProfileCR as HardwareProfile CR

    Note over Orchestrator,Operator: Flow 1: Workbenches CR Reconciliation
    Orchestrator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Workbenches CR<br/>(gatewayDomain, mlflowEnabled, platform)
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: Watch event (Workbenches CR changed)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    Operator->>FS: Read Kustomize manifests<br/>(kf-notebook-controller, odh-notebook-controller, notebooks)
    FS-->>Operator: Raw manifests
    Operator->>Operator: Render: overlay RELATED_IMAGE_* env vars,<br/>merge CR-derived parameters
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Server-Side Apply (SSA)<br/>field manager: workbenches-operator<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: Applied resources confirmed
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Update Workbenches status.phase<br/>(ModuleStatus lifecycle)

    Note over K8sAPI,HWWebhook: Flow 2: Notebook Admission (Hardware Profile)
    K8sAPI->>HWWebhook: POST /workbenches-hardware-profile<br/>Notebook CREATE/UPDATE<br/>HTTPS TLS (service-CA)<br/>Auth: TLS client cert
    HWWebhook->>K8sAPI: GET HardwareProfile CR<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>HWWebhook: HardwareProfile spec<br/>(resources, tolerations, nodeSelector)
    HWWebhook->>HWWebhook: Build JSON patch:<br/>resources, tolerations, nodeSelector,<br/>Kueue queue-name label
    HWWebhook-->>K8sAPI: AdmissionResponse (patch)<br/>HTTPS TLS (service-CA)

    Note over K8sAPI,ConnWebhook: Flow 3: Notebook Admission (Connection Injection)
    K8sAPI->>ConnWebhook: POST /workbenches-connection-notebook<br/>Notebook CREATE/UPDATE<br/>HTTPS TLS (service-CA)<br/>Auth: TLS client cert
    ConnWebhook->>K8sAPI: SubjectAccessReview<br/>(validate user can GET referenced secrets)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>ConnWebhook: SAR result (allowed/denied)
    ConnWebhook->>K8sAPI: GET referenced Secrets<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>ConnWebhook: Secret metadata
    ConnWebhook->>ConnWebhook: Build JSON patch:<br/>inject envFrom secret references
    ConnWebhook-->>K8sAPI: AdmissionResponse (patch)<br/>HTTPS TLS (service-CA)
